     5	profit searches until the doubling check passes or a cap is reached, and reports how much the estimates move.
     6	
     7	**Status.** Exploratory sensitivity, after the report. The frozen estimates and every registered decision stay primary.
     8	
     9	## 1. Cells
    10	
