    13	- **Profit (this run):** fresh0 C* D2+H3; fresh1 C* and F111 D2+H3; fresh3 C* D2+H3; fresh4 F111 D2+H3 (these five feed Q1
    14	  and Q4); headline F000, F001, F100, F101, F111 D2+H3 and F011, F100, F101, F111 X7-SC (Q2 and Q3, headline).
    15	- **Coalition (not in this run):** headline C* X6-SE/v2 total c2_synchronised, c5_staggered, c5_synchronised; C* X8-DB min
    16	  c2_roles; F111 X6-SE/v2 min c2_staggered, total c2_synchronised, c5_staggered. They are Q3-descriptive; repeated
    17	  doubling of a minimum-member search needs the joint-reference rescoring of the frozen coalition stages, which this
    18	  driver does not reimplement. They stay flagged in the paper. A separate plan can add them.
    19	
    20	## 2. Stopping rule and estimand
    21	
    22	- **Round k** (k = 1, 2, 3) continues the search from the best result so far with as many new restarts as registered
    23	  (`revision_v2.continue_search`, the previous best as incumbent, the merged archive), with restart seeds after every
    24	  earlier round's (`round_seed(k) = 1 + (k - 1) R`; CMA seeds never repeat, tested). It then reselects the reference from
    25	  the frozen menu plus the round's candidates, as the registered doubling stage does.
    26	- **Pass.** A round passes when both changes against the previous round, the attacker's best training value and the
    27	  reselected reference's mean normalised profit, are below the registered threshold 0.005 (the registered flag rule).
    28	  Stop at the first passing round. **Cap:** three rounds, four times the registered restarts in all. A cell that does
    29	  not pass is reported "not passed at the cap".
    30	- **Round 1** recomputes the registered doubling check; its two changes are compared with the report's at 1e-9 (a
    31	  built-in reproduction check; a disagreement is reported, not hidden).
    32	- **Winner.** The best training value over all rounds, evaluated on the 200 evaluation seeds against the unchanged frozen
    33	  reference (`gain_fields`, as the registered held-out diagnostic). The reselected references are diagnostics only.
