     1	"""The follow-up budget category of the reset experiment (docs/revision/reset-experiment-plan.md, draft 4, section 7).
     2	
     3	scripts/budget_v2.py is frozen (code freeze 627a2de) and has no way to add a category, so this module adds one under the
     4	same lock and validation: the author's written approval sets the program limit and the new `followup` cap together.
     5	Reservations and spend then go through budget_v2.reserve and budget_v2.record unchanged."""
     6	from __future__ import annotations
     7	
     8	import argparse
     9	import sys
